etter":"B.","html":"<span>are give</span>"},{"id":568,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>are being given</span>"},{"id":569,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>are giving</span>"}]},{"id":444,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The school _______ accommodation for the students.</div>","choices":[{"id":570,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>doesn't normally provide</span>"},{"id":571,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>isn't normally been provided</span>"},{"id":572,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>isn't normally being provided</span>"},{"id":573,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>isn't normally provide</span>"}]},{"id":445,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>She _______ of the accident yet.</div>","choices":[{"id":574,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>hasn't informed</span>"},{"id":575,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>hasn't been informed </span>"},{"id":576,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>hasn't being informed</span>"},{"id":577,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>wasn't been informed</span>"}]}]},{"id":57,"questions":[{"id":416,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I don’t like <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (tell) what to do.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":417,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The hotel was closed because it <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>. (renovate)</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":418,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I went to the doctor yesterday and I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (prescribe) some medicine for my cough.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":419,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>My car <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (not fix) yet, and I need it for tomorrow.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":420,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If she hadn’t insulted the police officer, she wouldn’t <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (arrest).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":421,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She is hoping <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (elect) president.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":422,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Last night’s fire might <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (cause) by lightning.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":423,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Our house <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>&nbsp;(paint)&nbsp;so we are staying at my parents’.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":424,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The museum <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (visit) by millions of people next year.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":425,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The suspect <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (question) by the police at the moment.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}